sequenceDiagram
    participant App as PocketCoder
    participant API as Anthropic API
    participant Tools as Tool Executor

    App->>API: messages.stream(prompt + tools)
    loop Until end_turn
        API-->>App: content_block (text)
        API-->>App: content_block (tool_use)
        App->>Tools: Execute tool (Read/Write/Edit/Bash/Glob/Grep)
        Tools-->>App: Tool result (string)
        App->>API: tool_result message
        API-->>App: content_block (text/tool_use)
    end
    API-->>App: stop_reason: end_turn
    App->>App: Parse final result
    App->>App: Update metrics
